"1323696752673419", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "1_3.png", "id": "4190503367835486", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824322_4190503371168819_3499253671679409380_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=irLj5k_ZPe0Q7kNvwHPu3-Y&_nc_oc=AdpfXZeHq3XOBZrEOqtOkPLkgEVgO5QBGIuDBMZKdpzfDRYFUvBPBj7dpfCrnTjsu7k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7YFuZ1kBOOpbIg3DQpmX76o7n_N2Ub5GPzA5wtX5V3Xw&oe=6A088521"}, {"file_name": "2 (5).png", "id": "753740947441490", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_753740950774823_8927377634821960094_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yCDurvO0awkQ7kNvwEZTECC&_nc_oc=Adroszo8sr5Ztl2FfnZdiTqHLKwnmELdsa47sSRGrX719X9aQOe8kdK354Hs1vnkFQU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7Le-32BCqqCnGboqPiAIoJi3aob3X5JrhqX0InqHJL1w&oe=6A0867AB"}, {"file_name": "3 (1).png", "id": "1078601071112352", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_1078601077779018_6923956179579249242_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yRdMpkpUG5YQ7kNvwEUX3sB&_nc_oc=AdpSBis7TxeHZjVi7XCM5qpR9qeUrMLScgfJp66o8IYKNwWPJyrTIgp7DRVyzdKVuF4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4HfLoO4WNcPjK3HHsdq82lJBK7xd6voMbQOFwytqzBdg&oe=6A086755"}, {"file_name": "upscalemedia-transformed.png", "id": "1220256443236903", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818852_1220256446570236_7864824056238529679_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e95lOpykobEQ7kNvwGynRQ1&_nc_oc=Adrdd4NLamKg_vzq6Yt351cIj6Z3xEq_O1-bC7otxTnEVfk7F4RU6VykIdFQSIZ71i4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af53btnHr0ETxpiNfEr6xMfffJiR-NGAbChX9GEsA6Ef0A&oe=6A087438"}, {"file_name": "upscalemedia-transformed (1).png", "id": "635111212607291", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_635111215940624_5918210519051409960_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1oLgSFcGndkQ7kNvwHogtlL&_nc_oc=AdpF2zmt8qglLfyUXWYUQzZeEgQtUarK95izcCLbqenzn44SN-yWfzi40SgNUsvqHDo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Vlna8Aso72aMJQYCeMlBDBJtJmHNhyugQ56n9QOI5Dw&oe=6A088964"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Meta_2560x1440_COVER_LOGO.png", "id": "1334572274913150", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_1334572278246483_972714864886085053_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nDMawWHmfqIQ7kNvwHgfx1c&_nc_oc=AdrX-giq7TR2jggVhVyqRqrIYDMTNx1h94h2C41WyU5a-6ud_PY687vZMyADKE-qKkw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5rD11ZAAEiIiq0GTbchydsQp0r_mkH7z14a9ZijE7SRw&oe=6A0863D3"}, "display_name": "Fixer Undercover", "keywords": ["Puzzle", "Adventure", "Espionage", "DUO", "EscapeRoom"], "long_description": "ONE AGENT. ONE DRONE. MANY RULES TO BREAK.\n\nWelcome to FIXER UNDERCOVER, a single-player VR espionage adventure where you are the silent professional and your only partner is a talkative, high-strung drone.\n\nYOUR MISSION\nYou play as Agent 404 (codename: Fixer), who infiltrates Redemption Prison disguised as an ordinary maintenance worker. Warden Viktor Kozlov runs the \"Born Again\" rehabilitation program, which achieves astonishing results\u2014criminals leave transformed. But as public praise grows, so does the Agency's suspicion. Millions from mysterious sponsors are flowing into Kozlov's private account. Your real mission is to investigate what truly lies behind the program's success. What is happening behind those walls? And who is financing it?\n\nYOUR PARTNER: WINSTON\nYou're not alone. You're accompanied by Winston, a talkative drone that not only delivers necessary equipment and hacks security systems but also offers constant advice and commentary. The humorous, \"buddy cop\" dynamic between the stoic agent and his anxious partner is the heart of the adventure. Together, you'll form a duo that must cooperate, even if it means friendly banter at the most inappropriate moments.\n\nGAMEPLAY: TOOLS & CREATIVITY\nThis is a game about having fun solving puzzles and finding satisfaction in discovering non-obvious solutions.\n\nOrdinary Tools, Extraordinary Applications: A power drill, angle grinder, or adjustable wrench serve not only for repairs but also for hacking systems and collec\n{3161711760645195}", "short_description": "You are an undercover agent. Your partner Winston is a talkative, high-strung drone. Infiltrate a high-security prison, using ordinary tools in extraordinary ways to solve puzzles and uncover a conspiracy. In this VR adventure, every problem is a puzzle, and your partner is the biggest one. Do you accept the mission?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fixerundercover.com/privacy-policy-en.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Przemek Koncewicz", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.fixerundercover.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24304483352556121"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 6, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1718105949363872"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1271174781886318"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1264951888938966"}, {